      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w17.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "clearSprites"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w17.node.direction.mimi.opening",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s2.w17.asset.sprite.mimi.tsukkomi",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w17.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w17.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "赤線の三本目、胴元総取りの条文。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w17.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w17.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "祭りの前の日に、引いた。理由は簡単。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w17.node.line.001c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w17.line.001c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "行列が戻って、外れ札を額に飾る胴元まで出た。翌日、謝酒祭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w17.node.line.001d",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w17.line.001d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "今年も来た。噴水が、うっすら発泡してる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w17.node.line.001e",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w17.line.001e",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "白い手袋の査定官さんも、今年も来た。「資産価値の定期査定です」",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w17.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w17.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "査定官さんは、去年を覚えていない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w17.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w17.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "焼きとうもろこしに「プライスレス」って付けた夜も、湯気になって消えた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w17.node.line.002c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w17.line.002c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "希望欄の束に、目元を押さえてたことも。ぜんぶ、無し。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w17.node.line.002d",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w17.line.002d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "名刺を、初対面の顔で渡された。私も、初対面の顔で受け取った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w17.node.line.002e",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w17.line.002e",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "二度目の、はじめまして。何回やるんですか、私たち。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w17.node.line.002f",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w17.line.002f",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "耳が、ちょっと、へこんだ。たぶん、大丈夫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w17.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w17.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "今年も、竜のお客様が火酒を勧めてきた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w17.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w17.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「感謝の杯を断るのは、決闘の申し込みじゃぞ」査定官さんは、今年も、職務の顔のまま飲んだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w17.node.line.003c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w17.line.003c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "台帳が無くても、人は同じ道で転ぶ。安心する転び方だった。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w17.node.direction.mimi.shift.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s2.w17.asset.sprite.mimi.smile",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w17.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w17.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "三十分後。酔った査定官さんの値札は、今年も詩になった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w17.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w17.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "夕焼けの値札は「評価不能(良い意味で)」赤線の一覧の前で、長いこと立ち止まってた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w17.node.line.004c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w17.line.004c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "そっと、一枚貼った。「赤線: プライスレス」",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w17.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w17.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「……いい仕事ですね、これは」去年も、同じ顔で同じこと、言ってましたよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w17.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w17.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "それは、言わないでおいた。覚えてない人との二度目の友情は、教えないのが礼儀だと思う。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w17.node.direction.mimi.shift.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s2.w17.asset.sprite.mimi.serious",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w17.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w17.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "宴もたけなわ。酔いの深くなった査定官さんが、ぽろりとこぼした。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w17.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w17.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「決勝の日程……上が、何か企んでますよ」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w17.node.line.006c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w17.line.006c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「同日に、何か、大きいのを……ぶつけるとか、なんとか」",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w17.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w17.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "同日に、大きいのを、ぶつける。え。胸の奥で、嫌な予感が組み上がった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w17.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w17.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "会社の目玉興行。滅亡ショー。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w17.node.line.007c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w17.line.007c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "うちの決勝。三つが、一つの日付へ滑り出す音がした。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w17.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w17.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "翌朝、素面に戻った査定官さんは、完璧な職務の顔で帰っていった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w17.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w17.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「赤線: プライスレス」の値札だけ、ノノさんが「正式な備品です」と残した。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w17.node.line.008c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w17.line.008c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "ただ、酔いの本音がこぼした「同日」の二文字だけ、喉の奥に残った。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "effect",
      "id": "main.s2.w17.node.effect.001",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "sharedPoints",
          "amount": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "main.s2.w17.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
